&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Content-addressed file (one per distinct bytes): storage keys, hashes, dimensions, moderation. Shared by every asset with the same content.
Features: TC-P1-006, NFR-04
Checks: byte_size &gt; 0; (kind = &#x27;video&#x27;) = (duration_ms IS NOT NULL); octet_length(sha256) = 32
Indexes: (phash_band0); (phash_band1); (phash_band2); (phash_band3)
