Features: FR-04/05, TC-P1-005/008, Arch v2 §4
Unique: UNIQUE (brand_id, model_number_normalized) WHERE model_number_normalized IS NOT NULL AND brand_id IS NOT NULL AND status &lt;&gt; &#x27;merged&#x27;
Checks: (status = &#x27;merged&#x27;) = (merged_into_product_id IS NOT NULL); merged_into_product_id IS NULL OR merged_into_product_id &lt;&gt; id; identity_confidence BETWEEN 0 AND 1; public_slug ~ &#x27;^[a-z0-9-]{6,80}$&#x27;; model_number_normalized IS NULL OR model_number_normalized ~ &#x27;^[A-Z0-9]+$&#x27;
Indexes: gist (canonical_name gist_trgm_ops(siglen=64)); (model_number_normalized); (category_id, status)
Composite FKs: (current_passport_id, id) → passports(id, product_id)
Rules: Merge target may not itself be merged (trigger). merge_products(src, dst) moves aliases, media, wallet items, reviews (function)." id="4_t_products"><mxCell style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=2;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="682" width="434" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="4_r_products_id" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=#fafafa;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="4_t_products"><mxGeometry y="30" width="434" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4_r_products_id_c0" value="PK" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="4_r_products_id"><mxGeometry x="0" width="34" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="34" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4_r_products_id_c1" value="id" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontStyle=5;fontColor=#888888;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="4_r_products_id"><mxGeometry x="34" width="186" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="186" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4_r_products_id_c2" value="uuid" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="4_r_products_id"><mxGeometry x="220" width="214" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="214" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><UserObject label="★ &lt;b&gt;source_records&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27; color=&#x27;#555555&#x27;&gt;append-only&lt;/font&gt;" tooltip="Raw payload of every fetched external record, versioned by content hash — reprocess without re-fetching.
Features: Arch v2 §10, TC-P1-008
Unique: UNIQUE (data_source_code, record_type, external_id, payload_sha256)
