"1" parent="7_r_referrals_created_at"><mxGeometry x="220" width="214" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="214" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;coin_ledger_entries&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27; color=&#x27;#555555&#x27;&gt;append-only&lt;/font&gt;" tooltip="Append-only TelCoin ledger. Only status moves (pending→confirmed|frozen|reversed, frozen→confirmed|reversed). Writes go through coin_* functions.
Features: TC-P1-016/017, Arch v2 §6
Unique: UNIQUE (reverses_entry_id) WHERE entry_type IN (&#x27;clawback&#x27;,&#x27;refund&#x27;)
Checks: amount &lt;&gt; 0; entry_type NOT IN (&#x27;earn&#x27;,&#x27;level_bonus&#x27;,&#x27;refund&#x27;) OR amount &gt; 0; entry_type NOT IN (&#x27;spend&#x27;,&#x27;clawback&#x27;) OR amount &lt; 0; entry_type NOT IN (&#x27;spend&#x27;,&#x27;clawback&#x27;,&#x27;refund&#x27;,&#x27;adjustment&#x27;) OR status = &#x27;confirmed&#x27;; entry_type NOT IN (&#x27;clawback&#x27;,&#x27;refund&#x27;) OR reverses_entry_id IS NOT NULL; entry_type NOT IN (&#x27;earn&#x27;) OR rule_code IS NOT NULL; status &lt;&gt; &#x27;pending&#x27; OR confirmable_at IS NOT NULL
Indexes: (user_id, created_at DESC); (user_id, rule_code, subject_id) WHERE entry_type = &#x27;earn&#x27;; (confirmable_at) WHERE status = &#x27;pending&#x27;
Rules: Status transitions validated by trigger. coin_earn(): locks coin_balances row, enforces daily cap (app_settings rewards.daily_cap), limits, idempotency. coin_spend(): locks balance row, requires confirmed_balance ≥ cost. coin_clawback(): may drive confirmed_balance negative (debt repaid by future earnings).
Append-only (may change: status, status_changed_at, fraud_hold_id, confirmable_at)." id="7_t_coin_ledger_entries"><mxCell style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=1;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=0;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;fillColor=#fde9d9;strokeColor=#c0504d;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="624" y="110" width="434" height="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="7_t_coin_ledger_entries"><mxGeometry y="30" width="434" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id_c0" value="PK" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id"><mxGeometry x="0" width="34" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="34" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id_c1" value="id" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontStyle=5;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id"><mxGeometry x="34" width="186" height="20" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="186" height="20" as="alternateBounds"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id_c2" value="uuid" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="7_r_coin_ledger_entries_id"><mxGeometry x="220" width="214" height="20" 